# 17. User Balance

This is extremely important.

The balance should not simply be:

```javascript
let balance = 0;
```

on the frontend.

The backend/database should be authoritative.

When a reward is earned:

```text
Reward event
     ↓
Backend validates event
     ↓
Backend calculates reward
     ↓
Backend updates balance
     ↓
Backend creates transaction
```

Ideally, the balance update and transaction creation should happen atomically so you don't end up with:

> Balance increased but no transaction

or:

> Transaction created but balance wasn't updated.

