# 23. Firebase / Database Architecture

If Firebase is being used for authentication/database, keep the architecture clean.

For example:

```text
Authentication
      ↓
Firebase Auth
      ↓
User UID
      ↓
Database
```

And for admins:

```text
Firebase Auth UID
      ↓
admins/{uid}
      ↓
role: admin
active: true
```

But **don't put sensitive financial authority in frontend Firestore rules alone** if your architecture requires privileged server operations.

Financial operations should go through trusted backend/server-side logic.

